&lt;p&gt;Just. One. More!  This cap was uncovered but would normally be an inch or two BGL.   A quick find before calling it a day and seeking shelter for the night.  Thanks for a day of fun caps to break up the physical caches and our journey, ofth.  &lt;img src="/images/icons/icon_smile_big.gif" border="0" align="middle" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

