          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP520 - Redwater&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Heading home from Cold Lake after the SRT mega I figured I'd hit as many caps as i could on the way home.  I kind of figured i'd found it, but it was buried in some tough to move clay like soil (at least with my fingers), so I dug out what i could find in the car, which turned out to be a broken hockey stick, made quick work of the dirt, it was only 2-3cm down.  &lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
